  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia buy-in project under CASA 205118-411</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the opportunities and climate resilience of smallholder farmers through the adoption of sustainable agricultural practices which raise incomes and support biodiversity. The programme will also support sustainable and inclusive agribusiness models, particularly those which trade with smallholders, to access investment and improve the sustainability of their operations.

The project budget for 24/25 FY is &#xa3;150k</narrative>
  </description>
